       "tex": "\\mk{F}{\\kFmag} \\approx \\mk{R}{\\hbar\\kk\\underbrace{\\frac{2\\kgammaonetwo|\\kOmega|^2}{\\kgammaonetwo^2 + \\kdelta^2}}_{\\kRoptzero}\\left(1 + \\frac{2\\kdelta\\kk\\cdot\\kv}{\\kgammaonetwo^2 + \\kdelta^2}\\right)}",
